crates/adept/tests/fixtures/rules/sl105_setext_heading/SKILL.md:2:1: SL004 frontmatter `name` ("sl105-setext-heading") does not match the containing directory name ("sl105_setext_heading")
  fix: rename the `name` field to "sl105_setext_heading", or rename the directory to "sl105-setext-heading"
crates/adept/tests/fixtures/rules/sl105_setext_heading/SKILL.md:5:1: SL105 heading "Title" uses setext form; `adept fmt` will rewrite it to ATX (h1)
  fix: write it as `# Title`, or run `adept fmt` to rewrite it
crates/adept/tests/fixtures/rules/sl105_setext_heading/SKILL.md:8:1: SL103 heading level jumps from h1 to h3 ("Skipped Level") without an intervening heading
  fix: use h2 instead, or add the missing intervening heading levels
crates/adept/tests/fixtures/rules/sl105_setext_heading/SKILL.md:10:1: SL105 heading "Sub" uses setext form; `adept fmt` will rewrite it to ATX (h2)
  fix: write it as `## Sub`, or run `adept fmt` to rewrite it
crates/adept/tests/fixtures/rules/sl105_setext_heading/SKILL.md:15:1: SL105 heading "#hashtag start of setext" uses setext form; `adept fmt` will rewrite it to ATX (h1)
  fix: write it as `# #hashtag start of setext` (the leading `#` is the ATX marker; the heading text itself starts with `#`), or run `adept fmt` to rewrite it
